  "description": "The Nulane C:62 SLT combines the low weight and comfort of a C:62® carbon frame and carbon fork with slick, reliable components. Sram's electronic Rival XPLR AXS 1x13 gears put a huge range of closely-spaced, hill-devouring ratios at your fingertips. Powerful, progressive Magura MT4 hydraulic disc brakes ensure you're always in full control of your speed. There's a light, dependable Newmen Performance R32 wheelset with grippy 50mm Schwalbe G-One R tyres. And with loads of tyre clearance, it's easy to set up as a bespoke commuter or tourer, too. Gravel or tarmac, city or countryside... it's your choice.",
